# Fair guidance test and gradient routing (server reader)

Every run saved a checkpoint every 5 epochs and each one was scored on whiteboard validation (familiar), new writers and fresh boards. Recipe numbers are the mean of 2 seeds. Mean line CER (%), lower is better.

| Recipe | What |
|---|---|
| S0 | guidance on (NRTR trains the backbone) |
| G0 | guidance off (CTC + NRTR train the whole backbone) |
| RE | routing early: CTC trains stem + stages 1-2 |
| RL | routing late: CTC trains stages 3-4 |

